<title>USA: Suffern, N.Y., won by Roosevelt.</title>
<headline>Suffern, N.Y., won by Roosevelt.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Roosevelt &amp; Cross Inc. said it won $1.935 million of Suffern, N.Y., various purposes bonds, 1997, with a true interest cost of 4.99 percent.</p>
